OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 160 tyres dumped in
OL,4,Aalley in broad daylight
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 160 tyres were dumped in an
OL,7,Falleyway behind people's homes in broad
OL,8,Fdaylight.
OL,10,FMen were seen unloading them from a
OL,11,Fwhite van and leaving them in the
OL,12,FCoppice area of Anfield, Liverpool, on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FLiverpool City Council Liberal group
OL,16,Fleader Steve Radford said they
OL,17,Fpresented a major fire risk for
OL,18,Fpeople's houses, and said he wanted to
OL,19,Fsee the perpetrators caught and jailed.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
